  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A heater is used to supply energy to a substance initially in the solid state. The graph shows how the temperature of the substance varies with time.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The mass of the substance is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> kg and the latent heat of vaporization of the substance is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\"></span> kJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. What is the power rating of the heater?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"250\"></span> W</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"330\"></span> W</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2500\"></span> W</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3300\"></span> W</li>\n</ol>"
  },
